# --- Client source material (assets-source/) -----------------------------------------
# Originals contain personal data, business documents, third-party screenshots, unlicensed
# fonts/stock and sensitive unrelated material. They are NOT versioned; keep them
# in the shared project drive. Only the README is tracked. Opt specific files in deliberately.
assets-source/*
!assets-source/README.md

# storage:migrate per-file reports (object keys, sizes)
storage-migration-report*.json
